                    "text": "Democrats like Meng frame GOP shutdowns as crises while pushing policies that prioritize illegal immigrants over citizens. Shutdowns happen because Democrats refuse to cut waste\u2014like sneaking healthcare expansions for migrants into budget bills under \u201celigibility clarifications.\u201d\n\nTaxpayer funds should secure borders and support federal workers, not reward lawbreaking. Real solutions? Lock down the border, audit every dollar, and put Americans first.\n\nMeng\u2019s \u201cconversation\u201d is just another distraction from her party\u2019s open-borders spending addiction.\n\nSee how the numbers and policy maneuvers stack up for yourself: https://t.co/oZViOOPm5t",
