                    "text": "Democrats like Meng scream about GOP \u201chealthcare crises\u201d while pushing benefits for illegal immigrants through every shutdown. Trump\u2019s America First stance protects Social Security, Medicare, and veterans\u2019 care\u2014prioritizing citizens over D.C.\u2019s endless handouts to those breaking our laws.\n\nTaxpayer dollars shouldn\u2019t fund bureaucratic loopholes that reward illegal entry. Shutdowns happen when Democrats refuse to negotiate, choosing migrant benefits over American workers.\n\nCut the waste, secure the border, fund Americans first.",
