                    "text": "Grace Meng\u2019s senior center photo ops don\u2019t change the fact that Mamdani\u2019s City Hall is gutting services Queens seniors actually rely on. While Adams reopened Section 8 waitlists and moved 16K households out of shelters, Mamdani pushes rent freezes that collapse housing stock and redirects funds to activist pet projects. His \u201cequity\u201d agenda means NYCHA repairs stall as nonprofits feast.\n\nSliwa fought migrant hotel takeovers destroying neighborhoods\u2014Mamdani funds them. That Aging Department logo? Just cover for a mayor who treats seniors as props while dismantling the systems Adams built.\n\nQuality of life? Mamdani\u2019s version: rationed care, unstaffed centers, and budgets hijacked by ideology. Queens deserves real solutions, not hashtag governance.",
